#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Umicom Framework
# File: cmake/UmicomBrokerConnectivityExecutionPlatform.cmake
#
# PURPOSE:
#   Complete provider-neutral broker connectivity, paper trading, account/order/
#   execution/position synchronisation, pre-trade risk, reconciliation, audit
#   and the Interactive Brokers adapter boundary.
#
# ARCHITECTURE:
#   Canonical Umicom::trading records, risk services, broker ABI and simulated
#   broker remain authoritative. Vendor types never cross Framework public C ABI
#   boundaries. Live trading remains approval-gated and is never auto-armed.
#
# AUTHOR AND ORGANISATION:
#   Sammy Hegab
#   Umicom Foundation
#
# LICENCE:
#   MIT
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
